  "compressor": "bought TC-class Al 2618 (forged, 5-axis milled) backswept splitter impeller D2 ~276 mm (TPS52/57-F, TCR16/18, MET18-22 class - ESTIMATE, verify with supplier drawing), our vaned diffuser (2.5D) + scroll; or the TC maker's compressor casing if its inlet fits the annular plenum",
  "combustor": "single vertical reverse-flow can (Kawasaki M1A-style) inside the cool casing; diffusion/partially premixed gas swirl injector; Nimonic 75 liner",
  "turbine": "bought TC-class cast IN713LC radial/mixed-flow wheel D4 ~285-290 mm friction-welded to our shaft by the supplier; 2.5D nozzle ring (alloy X / 2.4665) in a floating hot plenum inside the cool pressure casing",
  "generator": "2-pole SmCo PMG ~330 kW shaft at 35k rpm (583 Hz): own design with stator/rotor kit from a high-speed machine shop (e+a CH, or similar) or a bought HS machine (Safran GENeUS 300 FR - inquire 24/7 rating); 4Q regenerative AC/AC drive",
  "bearings": "4 + 1 hybrid ceramic angular-contact spindle bearings 40x68x15 (7008 class) on O-ring SFDs, closed oil-jet, VG 32",
  "coupling": "D2 idea scaled: quill with a crowned external spline/hex drive into the compressor-nose socket (slide-on, +/-1 mm float)"
